From 6f9173281008c22133e56379fdda286257ea8e1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Egner <m.egner@gmx.net>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:57:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] release: v1.3.9 - add optional sku to Product and
 ProductUpdatedEvent

Adds `optional string sku` to catalog.v1.Product (13), CreateProductRequest (10),
UpdateProductRequest (11) and catalog.events.v1.ProductUpdatedEvent (13).
Request fields are validated with min_len 1, max_len 64 and
pattern ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*$ (a leading '$' must be rejected because
query-side read models write the value inside aggregation pipelines).

NOTE: gen/ (Go and TypeScript) was NOT regenerated - no buf toolchain was
available. Run `make generate` with the pinned tools and amend gen/ into this
release before pushing VERSION to master.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
