From 7b1449807127ad7ac80936cbd87cea126ed79d06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Egner <m.egner@gmx.net>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:57:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(product): add optional SKU to product aggregate,
 persistence, RPC and event

- Product gains SKU *string; NewProduct/NewProductWithID/Reconstruct/Update take
  sku after description. Update always assigns it (nil clears, full-replace).
- validateSKU rejects "", >64 chars, and values not matching the API pattern.
- Mongo entity stores `sku,omitempty`; mapper maps both directions.
- Connect handlers read req.Msg.Sku directly (not GetSku()); toProtoProduct and
  ProductUpdatedEvent carry Sku.
- Tests updated for the new signatures, plus SKU validation, handler, mapper,
  repository (clear on update) and event factory coverage.

Requires ecommerce-catalog-service-api v1.3.9 (generated Sku fields).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
